# Worktrees and agent scratch. Both are excluded via `.git/info/exclude` rather than
# `.gitignore`, which git honors and prettier never reads — so `check:format` walked into
# a sibling worktree's build output and failed locally for a reason CI structurally cannot
# reproduce, having no worktrees. The `/dist` above is root-anchored and does not cover
# `.worktrees/<name>/dist`.
/.worktrees
/.agent
package-lock.json
package.json

# Cloudflare deployment config. Prettier would add trailing commas ("trailingComma":
# "all"). Wrangler parses those fine, but VS Code flags them as jsonc(519) errors, so
# the only effect is red squiggles in the one file whose breakage CI cannot see.
wrangler.jsonc

# Agent scratch: a full copy of the tree, so prettier would walk it and double every run.
/.probe-sandbox
